book><name>HAYASHI, HIROAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADE, TAKUMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A thermal print head (1) comprises a substrate (2), electrode patterns (3) having a common electrode and a plurality of discrete electrodes formed on the substrate, heating resistors (5) connected with the electrode patterns (3), and a protection coating (8) deposited on the substrate (2) and consisting of a plurality of layers (81, 82, 83, 84) to cover the electrode patterns (3) and the heating resistors (5). The outermost layer (84) of the protection coating (8) contains SiC as a main ingredient and carbon as an additive.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une tête d'impression thermique (1) qui comprend un substrat (2), des réseaux d'électrodes (3) comportant une électrode commune et plusieurs électrodes discrètes formées sur le substrat, des résistances chauffantes (5) reliées aux réseaux d'électrodes (3), et un revêtement de protection (8) posé sur le substrat (2) et constitué de plusieurs couches (81, 82, 83, 84) recouvrant les réseaux d'électrodes (3) et les résistances chauffantes (5). La couche superficielle (84) du revêtement de protection (8) contient SiC comme ingrédient principal et du carbone comme produit d'addition.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>